# ⭐ Desired Air-Water Fusion (Native Emoji)
# Using modal to express wish/hope

# Visual:
#   ⭐ ❴ 💨 plus 💧 ❵
#
# Meaning: "I wish/hope that air and water would fuse"
# Modal: DESIRED (optative mood - expressing wish)
#
# Modal system:
#   🤔 maybe (potential)  - "might happen"
#   ❗ must (necessary)   - "must happen, required"
#   🚫 forbidden          - "must NOT happen"
#   📋 should (obligated) - "ought to happen"
#   ⭐ wish (desired)     - "I hope/wish for this"
#
# This fusion creates MIST - the gentle union of air and water.
# The ⭐ shows this is aspirational, not commanded!

⭐ ❴ 💨 plus 💧 ❵
